.vscode

# Secret-bearing local config — commit templates only as *-DIST.* (see .cursor/rules/secrets-no-git.mdc)
**/application-local.properties
**/application-local.yaml
**/application-local.yml

# Cluster-specific ConfigMap overlay (copy from deploy/openshift/application-cluster-overlay.example.yaml).
# Contains quarkus.oidc.enabled, security groups, and other deployment-specific values — never commit.
**/application-cluster-overlay.yaml

# Quarkus extension metadata file does not belong in application repos.
META-INF/quarkus-extension.properties
